# w3id.org redirects for CAMPOP — Cambridge Group for the History of
# Population and Social Structure, University of Cambridge.
#
# Maintainer: Stephen Gadd — https://github.com/docuracy
#
# Namespace layout — identifiers are grouped by entity type, not by dataset,
# because a place is the same place whichever dataset attests it:
#
#   /campop/                  → CAMPOP homepage
#   /campop/place/{id}        → a place
#   /campop/source/{id}       → a source (a published list or record series)
#   /campop/criterion/{id}    → a named, versioned selection criterion
#   /campop/context           → JSON-LD context document
#
# Entity-level rules will be added in a follow-up pull request when the
# corresponding static API is deployed; see README.md for the intended URI
# scheme. Only rules with live targets are enabled here.

Options +FollowSymLinks
RewriteEngine on

Header set Access-Control-Allow-Origin *
Header set Access-Control-Allow-Headers "Accept"

# --- Namespace homepage ---
RewriteRule ^$ https://www.campop.geog.cam.ac.uk/ [R=303,L]
